{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-09",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "移動中に脚本を書き直す  (Rewriting the Script on the Move)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "driver": "配達員",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "student": "生徒"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out on a downtown street without a filming permit, Muranishi directs his bold opening sequence until the actors refuse to strip in public and a patrol officer pulls up. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいか、今からタイトルが出るシーンを撮影する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君たちは向こうからこっちに歩いてくる。カメラは背後だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "歩いてきたら、ここで立ち止まる。立ち止まって三秒数える。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "三秒数えたらカメラに振り返る。いいな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "こんなとこで裸になれないし、恥じらいは？って。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そこはコントラストなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっと待って、落ち着いて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "ケンカはダメよ。ちょっと黙ってて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうした？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もう行っていいって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "どの国でも警官は態度がでかいな。ここで撮影するのはもうやめたほうがいいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かった。移動中に脚本を書き直す。撤収だ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいか、今からタイトルが出るシーンを撮影する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen up, right now we're shooting the scene where the main title appears.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君たちは向こうからこっちに歩いてくる。カメラは背後だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You walk from over there toward here. The camera is behind you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "歩いてきたら、ここで立ち止まる。立ち止まって三秒数える。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once you walk up, stop right here. Stop and count three seconds.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "三秒数えたらカメラに振り返る。いいな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After counting three seconds, turn back toward the camera. Got it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "こんなとこで裸になれないし、恥じらいは？って。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says she can't strip in a place like this, and asks where the subtlety is.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そこはコントラストなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's all about the contrast!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ちょっと待って、落ち着いて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second, calm down!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "ケンカはダメよ。ちょっと黙ってて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No fighting! Please stay quiet for a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうした？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もう行っていいって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The officer says we're free to go now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "どの国でも警官は態度がでかいな。ここで撮影するのはもうやめたほうがいいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Police have big attitudes in every country. We really shouldn't film here anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かった。移動中に脚本を書き直す。撤収だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it. I'll rewrite the script while we're moving. Pack it up!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
